{"unit_id":"tag:039X:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环映射（ring map），并设<MATH_0002>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的。置<MATH_0003>。如果针对<MATH_0004>的所有下降（descent）数据（data）都是有效（effective）的，那么针对<MATH_0005>的所有下降（descent）数据（data）也都如此。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"给定环映射及底环变换。"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射","context":"下降所针对的环映射。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"基变换前后的下降数据。"},{"source_term":"data","target_term":"数据","context":"所有下降数据。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"下降数据来自底环模；后半句按原文so are保留省略表述。"}],"notes":[]}
